<title>south korea: S.Korean bond yields end lower on bargain hunting.</title>
<headline>S.Korean bond yields end lower on bargain hunting.</headline>
<text>
<p>Bond yields closed lower on Tuesday as institutions increased bargain hunting after the recent rises in the yields, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight call rates remained unchanged, they said.</p>
<p>* 3-yr corporates close at 12.43 pct vs Monday's 12.48</p>
<p>* 3-mth CDs end at 13.80 pct vs Monday's 14.00</p>
<p>* Average overnight call rate unchanged at 15.75 pct</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
